 Should you go swimming when it's lightning?

00:55:29.360 --> 00:55:36.360 align:start position:0%
 I don't know, I guess the hotel staff would have told us to go back inside.

00:55:36.360 --> 00:55:40.360 align:start position:0%
 If they thought we were in danger.

