 Because we're on the fourth floor, so we're not that high up.

00:56:12.360 --> 00:56:17.360 align:start position:0%
 So I'm guessing the lightning wouldn't strike the water first.

00:56:17.360 --> 00:56:19.360 align:start position:0%
 It would strike the top of the building.

00:56:19.360 --> 00:56:21.360 align:start position:0%
 If it wasn't that I'd say, let me know.

